        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FDB218, Solid Brass Floor Mount Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis medium size floor mount door stop is typically used in residential and medium duty commercial applications. The 2-1/8\" high floor mounted door stop is made of solid brass by Deltana. Packaged complete with all installation hardware including a heavy duty floor anchor for solid mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FDB218-specifications.gif?v=1704354582\" width=\"355\" height=\"153\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana FBD218 2-1/8 Inch Floor Mount Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FDB218 Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height to Center of Rubber Bumper: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Size Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-for-floor-door-stop-deltana-fdb218-rubber\"><b>Rubber Bumper</b></a>: 3/4\" Diameter, Gray Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FDB218.pdf?v=1704262219\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  FDB218 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
