                "description": "Solid Brass Floor Mount Door Bumper, Deltana FDB218 - This medium size floor mount door stop is typically used in residential and medium duty commercial applications. The 2-1/8 inch high floor mounted door stop is made of solid brass by Deltana. Packaged complete with all installation hardware including a heavy duty floor anchor for solid mounting. Available in 9 great finishes.",
